OL,3,GNEWSAHidden burial ground unearthed
OL,4,Aduring M5 dig
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "unique" Roman burial ground has been
OL,7,Funearthed during a dig at a motorway,
OL,8,Fwith features an archaeologist says she
OL,9,Fhas not seen anywhere else in the UK.
OL,11,FGloucestershire residents were invited
OL,12,Fto take a trip back in time on Thursday
OL,13,Fand see the discoveries made during
OL,14,Fpre-construction work on the M5
OL,15,Fjunction 10 improvements scheme.
OL,17,FAda Torka-Lis, project officer for
OL,18,FArchaeological Research Services, said
OL,19,Fitems and skeletons from the
OL,20,FPaleolithic, Roman, and the Saxon
OL,21,Fperiods were discovered.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
