OL,3,GNEWSAHidden burial ground unearthed
OL,4,Aduring M5 dig
OL,5,
OL,6,FJulian Tooke of Gloucestershire County
OL,7,FCouncil said he was "really fired up"
OL,8,Fafter archaeologists uncovered burials
OL,9,Fsuggesting people of three different
OL,10,Freligions lived in the area 2,000 years
OL,11,Fago.
